## 20. MIGRATION VALIDATION CHECKLIST

Use this checklist after each phase:

- [ ] All existing API endpoints return same HTTP status codes
- [ ] Authentication still works (login, refresh, logout)
- [ ] Student Hub pages load correctly
- [ ] Faculty dashboard loads correctly
- [ ] AI Mentor responds to chat
- [ ] Wellness check-in saves correctly
- [ ] Gamification XP/streak updates correctly
- [ ] No Python import errors on startup
- [ ] `/docs` (Swagger) shows all routes
- [ ] No regression in notification delivery

